            "image": "shopify://shop_images/81z79y3mTTL.jpg",
            "text": "<p><strong>Classy, gorgeous fabric, well made, stunning!</strong></p><p>These chairs are so beautiful!  The fabric looks like a linen and raw silk blend! They are the perfect  complement our 23 year old Danish table!  Very classy!Love! Easy assembly too!</p>",
