            "text": "<p><strong>Super heavy and robust.</strong></p><p>Awesome desk, heavy but really solid. Lumidesk has exceeded my expectations. It's so beautiful. It looks luxury and premium compared to other same price range standing desks. Lightning fast customers service. I am an extremely happy customer.</p>",
